Description: A front-end to the 'BLUPF90' family of programs for pedigree- and
    genomic-based genetic evaluation. Provides wrappers to run 'RENUMF90',
    'BLUPF90+', 'GIBBSF90+', 'POSTGIBBSF90', 'PREDICTF90', 'PREGSF90' and
    'POSTGSF90', helpers to build the parameter and genotype input files, and a
    k-fold cross-validation routine for univariate models. The cross-validation
    reports predictive ability as the correlation between the corrected phenotype
    and the estimated breeding value, bias as the regression of the corrected
    phenotype on the estimated breeding value, and accuracy as that correlation
    divided by the square root of the heritability. The 'BLUPF90' executables are
    not distributed with this package and must be obtained separately from
    <https://nce.ads.uga.edu/wiki/doku.php?id=start>.
